1972
01:39:33.240 --> 01:39:35.976
BOBBY:
That's okay.

1973
01:39:36.009 --> 01:39:38.078
He didn't know what you did.

1974
01:39:38.111 --> 01:39:39.980
I had the ladder.

1975
01:39:40.013 --> 01:39:49.223
